<title>USA: PWG Capital Trust II sets $175 mln trust pfd secs.</title>
<headline>PWG Capital Trust II sets $175 mln trust pfd secs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of trust preferred securities from PWG Capital Trust II, a unit of PaineWebber Group Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager PaineWebber Inc.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $25 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER PWG CAPITAL TRUST II</p>
<p>AMT $175 MLN	  COUPON(DIV)8.08 PCT MATURITY 3/1/2037</p>
<p>TYPE TRST PFD SECS  YIELD 8.08 PCT	FIRST PAY 4/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2			     PAY FREQ MONTHLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS			    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: priced as seven million shares at $25 each. ((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
